msgid "<b>Auto Themes Introduction</b>"
msgstr "<b>自动主题说明</b>"

msgid "<b>Auto Themes for Dark/Light Modes</b>"
msgstr "<b>深色/浅色模式的自动主题</b>"

msgid "<b>Gnome Dark Mode:</b>"
msgstr "<b>GNOME 深色模式：</b>"

msgid "<b>Gnome Light Mode:</b>"
msgstr "<b>GNOME 浅色模式：</b>"

msgid "<b>Introduction</b>"
msgstr "<b>简介</b>"

msgid "<span  allow_breaks=\"true\">\n•  Auto-themes will use the <b>colors</b> derived from the background image.\n•  Other settings will be set as selected, by the user, in the other tabs.\n•  Styles will apply to the Top Bar, Menus and optionally to the shell.\n•  You may further tweak the styles after applying auto-theme.\n\n<b><tt>True Color  </tt></b>   :  Palette colors as-is (biased towards dark).\n<b><tt>Pastel Theme</tt></b>   :  Colors are pastelified (biased towards light).\n<b><tt>Dark Theme  </tt></b>   :  Colors are darkened as needed.\n<b><tt>Light Theme </tt></b>   :  Colors are lightened as needed.\n        </span>"
msgstr "<span  allow_breaks=\"true\">\n•  自动主题会使用从背景图片提取的<b>颜色</b>。\n•  其它设置保持用户在各标签页中的选择。\n•  样式将应用于顶栏、菜单，并可选择性应用到 Shell。\n•  应用自动主题后仍可继续微调样式。\n\n<b><tt>真彩色    </tt></b>   :  直接使用配色板颜色（偏暗）。\n<b><tt>柔和主题</tt></b>   :  颜色柔化（偏亮）。\n<b><tt>深色主题  </tt></b>   :  按需加深颜色。\n<b><tt>浅色主题 </tt></b>   :  按需提亮颜色。\n        </span>"

msgid "<span  allow_breaks=\"true\">\n•  Open Gnome Box allows you to theme the Top Bar, Pop-up Menus, Dash, Dock and rest of the Gnome Shell.\n•  You can also extend the theme to Gtk and Flatpak apps to the extent possible with CSS.\n•  You can choose any color for Accent and for everything else in the shell.\n•  There are a lot of settings to allow full customization and they are grouped as tabs in the left panel.\n•  To make things easier, there is an auto-theme feature that picks colors from the desktop background.\n•  You can start with selecting the Type of bar, then select the desired Auto-Theme and apply.\n•  Floating or Island bars are great on the desktop but when a window is maximized, you must try Window-Max bar.\n•  Next, you can apply styles to Dash/Dock, Shell and Apps as desired for full theming experience.\n•  Lastly, feel free to play with the settings and things will start becoming much easier.\n\n Open the theming bar and let the colors flow!\n        </span>"
msgstr "<span  allow_breaks=\"true\">\n•  Open Gnome Box 可以为主题化顶栏、弹出菜单、Dash、Dock 以及 GNOME Shell 的其余部分。\n•  你还可以尽可能地把主题扩展到 GTK 与 Flatpak 应用（受 CSS 能力所限）。\n•  强调色以及 Shell 中的其它一切颜色都可以自定义。\n•  设置项很多，足以实现完全定制，它们以标签页形式分组在左侧面板。\n•  为了更省事，提供了从桌面壁纸自动取色的自动主题功能。\n•  可以从选择顶栏类型开始，然后选中想要的自动主题并应用。\n•  浮动/岛屿风格在桌面上很好看，但窗口最大化时一定要试试 Window-Max 顶栏。\n•  接下来，可以按需为 Dash/Dock、Shell 与应用程序应用样式，获得完整的主题体验。\n•  最后，尽情调参吧，用起来会越来越顺手。\n\n 打开主题栏，让色彩流动起来！\n        </span>"

msgid "<span  allow_breaks=\"true\">\n•  Select themes for Dark/Light modes and click Apply.\n•  You may further tweak styles after applying auto-theme.\n•  Color changes made in current mode will be saved for that mode.\n•  Themes can be regenerated by clicking Apply or on background change.</span>"
msgstr "<span  allow_breaks=\"true\">\n•  为深色/浅色模式选择主题并点击“应用”。\n•  应用自动主题后仍可继续微调样式。\n•  在当前模式下所做的颜色修改会保存到该模式。\n•  点击“应用”或在壁纸变化时可重新生成主题。</span>"

msgid "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">Note for Dash-to-Dock:\n•  Enable 'Use built-in theme' in its settings under 'Appearance' tab.\n•  Set 'Icon size limit' as needed in its 'Position and Size' tab.\n </span>"
msgstr "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">Dash-to-Dock 提示：\n•  在其设置的「外观」标签页中启用「使用内置主题」。\n•  在「位置与大小」标签页中按需设置「图标尺寸限制」。\n </span>"

msgid "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">Styles primarily derived from panel menus will be applied to shell components as selected:</span>\n"
msgstr "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">主要从面板菜单推导出的样式将按所选应用到 Shell 组件：</span>\n"

msgid "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">Transparent Bar:\n•  Set Box/Margins Alpha to '0' and also Bar BG Alpha to '0'.\n•  Turn Off Panel Blur in 'Blur My Shell', if applied.\n</span>"
msgstr "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">透明顶栏：\n•  将「盒/边距透明度」设为 0，同时将「顶栏背景透明度」设为 0。\n•  如果使用了「Blur My Shell」，请关闭其中的面板模糊。\n</span>"

msgid "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">When Window-Max bar is enabled, the following properties will apply to the Bar when a window is maximized.\n</span>"
msgstr "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">启用 Window-Max 顶栏后，窗口最大化时以下属性将应用于顶栏。\n</span>"

msgid "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">\nAuto-Set Gtk/Icons Yaru theme that is closest to Open Gnome Box Accent.\nYaru themes need to be installed (default in Ubuntu).</span>"
msgstr "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">\n自动设置最接近 Open Gnome Box 强调色的 Gtk/图标 Yaru 主题。\n需要已安装 Yaru 主题（Ubuntu 默认自带）。</span>"

msgid "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">\n\nNote:\n•  Horizontal and Vertical paddings can be set in <b>Bar Highlights</b> tab.\n•  Accent color can be set in <b>Popup Menus</b> tab.\n•  Bar rounding radius can be set in <b>Bar Border</b> tab.</span>"
msgstr "<span allow_breaks=\"true\">\n\n注意：\n•  水平与垂直内边距可在<b>顶栏高亮</b>标签页中设置。\n•  强调色可在<b>弹出菜单</b>标签页中设置。\n•  顶栏圆角可在<b>顶栏边框</b>标签页中设置。</span>"

msgid "<span color=\"#00ddee\">Selected theme will apply in respective mode.</span>"
msgstr "<span color=\"#00ddee\">所选主题将在对应模式下生效。</span>"

msgid "<span color=\"#ff8c00\">Please select desired themes to apply.</span>"
msgstr "<span color=\"#ff8c00\">请先选择要应用的主题。</span>"

